runs/live_sampling_*/** whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
runs/ucf101_*/** whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
runs/ucf101_*.console.log whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
